<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Donate &mdash; Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation</title>
<meta name="description" content="Support respite, wellness and community for dementia caregivers with a gift to Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

{# Donate as its own page, Jacob-direct 2026-09-15: the nav item deserves a destination, not a
   scroll to the bottom of Home. The Home panel stays; both lead here. Giving runs through the
   GiveButter campaign Legacy already publishes on its current site. #}
{% set active_page = 'donate' %}
{% include '_header.html.j2' %}

<section class="hero has-media" style="padding: 56px 0 64px;">
  <img class="hero-media" src="media/headers/donate.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async">
  <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#eeddd2;">Donate</p>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);">Every caregiver deserves support.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Your gift provides respite, wellness opportunities, education and meaningful community experiences for dementia caregivers and the people they care for.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="https://givebutter.com/support-the-caregiver-sanctuary" class="btn btn-coral" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Make a Donation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Where it goes</span>
      <h2>What your support makes possible</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card"><h3>Respite</h3><p>Drop-in respite gives a caregiver a few hours to rest while their loved one is cared for and engaged.</p><a class="more" href="drop-in-respite.html">Drop-In Respite &rarr;</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Wellness &amp; community</h3><p>Community Series events, caregiver wellness programming and the Caregiver Sanctuary.</p><a class="more" href="programs-events.html">Programs &amp; Events &rarr;</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Education &amp; resources</h3><p>Guides, trusted referrals and local services that help families navigate the dementia journey.</p><a class="more" href="resources.html">Resource Hub &rarr;</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--sand);">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <span class="eyebrow">Other ways to give</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 14px;">Time and voice count too.</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 28px;">Volunteer at an event, join the community, or help spread the word. Every form of support reaches a caregiver.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="get-involved.html" class="btn btn-outline">Get Involved</a>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-plum" data-action="open-membership">Stay Connected</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_membership-modal.html.j2' %}
{% include '_footer.html.j2' %}

<script src="app.js"></script>
<script src="nav-v2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
